variant Expr ⟦ | Num(val ↦ int64) · | Identifier(name ↦ text) · ⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    Expr e ↦ variant_init Expr ⦅Num ↦ 42⦆ ·
    match e ⟦
        | Num(x) ⟹ emit "num" · emit x ·
        | Identifier(s) ⟹ emit "ident" · emit s ·
        otherwise ⟹ emit "unknown" ·
    ⟧
    yield 0 ·
⟧
